?\",\"HMN_07_1 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing the merit criteria\",\"HMN_07_2 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing job posters\",\"HMN_07_3 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing assessment tools\",\"HMN_07_4 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Conducting interviews\",\"HMN_07_5 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Reference checks\",\"HMN_07_6 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Appointments (for example: to create or provide a letter of offer, make a formal job offer, notification of placement in a pool)\",\"HMN_07_7 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Updating applicants on progress\",\"HMN_07_8 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Reviewing applications\",\"HMN_07_9 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Reviewing assessments (for example: written tests)\",\"HMN_07_10 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Ranking candidates\",\"HMN_07_11 -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Other\",\"HMN_07_11_ -- In which part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Other (please specify)\",\"HMN_08A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? The appointees meet the performance expectations of the positions for which they were hired.\",\"HMN_08B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I felt pressure to select a particular candidate.\",\"HMN_09_1 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Individuals with authority over me\",\"HMN_09_2 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Co-workers\",\"HMN_09_3 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Individuals reporting to me\",\"HMN_09_4 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Individuals from other departments or agencies\",\"HMN_09_5 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Individuals from outside the government\",\"HMN_09_6 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Selection board members\",\"HMN_09_7 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Elected officials or political staffers\",\"HMN_09_8 -- From whom did you experience this pressure? Other people\",\"HMN_10A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement regarding the staffing services you received? Overall, I am satisfied with the staffing services I have received from my organization.\",\"HMN_10B_1 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Aligning your staffing needs with the priorities of your department/agency's HR plan or People Management plan\",\"HMN_10B_2 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Consideration of persons with a priority entitlement\",\"HMN_10B_3 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Assessment accommodation measures\",\"HMN_10B_4 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Employment equity considerations\",\"HMN_10B_5 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Accessibility, diversity and inclusion\",\"HMN_10B_6 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Establishing the area of selection\",\"HMN_10B_7 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Establishing the merit criteria\",\"HMN_10B_8 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Advice, tools and guidance to support staffing decisions\",\"HMN_10B_9 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Finding new approaches to staffing\",\"HMN_10B_10 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Existing pools of candidates within your organization\",\"HMN_10B_11 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Federal Student Work Experience Program (FSWEP)\",\"HMN_10B_12 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Post-Secondary Co-Operative Education and Internship Program (CO-OP)\",\"HMN_10B_13 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Recruitment of Policy Leaders Program (RPL)\",\"HMN_10B_14 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Indigenous Career Pathways\",\"HMN_10B_15 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Virtual Door to Talent with Disabilities\",\"HMN_10B_16 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Research Affiliate Program\",\"HMN_10B_17 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Identifying and mitigating risks in staffing processes\",\"HMN_10B_18 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Legislative and policy interpretations\",\"HMN_10B_19 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Mobility and preference provisions under the Veterans Hiring Act\",\"HMN_10B_20 -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Other areas\",\"HMN_10B_20_ -- In which of the following areas would you like greater advice and guidance from staffing services? Other areas (please specify)\",\"HMN_10C  -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I receive adequate support from staffing advisors to reduce the time it takes to staff a vacant position.\",\"MAN_01 -- To what extent were you able to exercise your judgment or managerial discretion when making staffing decisions?\",\"MAN_02A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I am aware of my organization's Human Resources plan or People Management plan.\",\"MAN_02B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I feel equipped in identifying and mitigating biases and barriers in assessment methods that disadvantage persons belonging to an equity-seeking group.\",\"MAN_02C -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Staffing options available within my organization allow me to address my staffing needs as quickly as required.\",\"MAN_02D -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Staffing options available within my organization provide me with the flexibility to appoint persons to meet the needs of my work unit.\",\"MAN_02E -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I felt comfortable explaining staffing decisions to my employees.\",\"MAN_03  -- To what extent are you aware of your responsibilities related to considering persons with a priority entitlement when making appointments?\",\"MAN_04A_1 -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you consider (confirm interest, review eligibility) hiring a person with a priority entitlement?\",\"MAN_04A_2 -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you assess (screening, testing, interviewing) a person with a priority entitlement as part of a staffing process?\",\"MAN_04A_3 -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you hire (appointing or deploying) a person with a priority entitlement to a position?\",\"MAN_04A_4 -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? None of the above\",\"MAN_04B_1 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? Considering persons with a priority entitlement is not a staffing option recommended by my human resources advisor\",\"MAN_04B_2 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? The priority consideration process is unclear to me\",\"MAN_04B_3 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? The priority consideration process is too time consuming\",\"MAN_04B_4 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? The priority consideration process is complicated\",\"MAN_04B_5 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? The priority talent pool does not match my staffing needs\",\"MAN_04B_6 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? The priority consideration process does not let me select the best candidate for the position\",\"MAN_04B_7 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? No candidates were referred to me\",\"MAN_04B_8 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? I did not conduct any appointment processes\",\"MAN_04B_9 -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? Other\",\"MAN_04B_9_ -- Please explain why you did not consider, assess or hire a person with a priority entitlement? Other (please specify)\",\"MAN_05A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Persons with a priority entitlement are a valuable source of qualified candidates.\",\"MAN_05B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Persons with a priority entitlement that are hired meet performance expectations.\",\"MAN_06A_1 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Persons with a priority entitlement do not possess the essential qualifications\",\"MAN_06A_2 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Persons with a priority entitlement require additional training to get up to speed\",\"MAN_06A_3 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. I have a preferred candidate in mind\",\"MAN_06A_4 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Persons with a priority entitlement do not want to relocate for a position\",\"MAN_06A_5 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Persons with a priority entitlement do not meet the position requirements (for example: classification, conditions of employment or work location)\",\"MAN_06A_6 -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Other reasons\",\"MAN_06A_6_ -- You indicated that persons with a priority entitlement are not a valuable source of qualified canditates. Indicate the reasons why. Other reasons (please specify)\",\"ADV_01A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? When priority candidates were referred, managers were open to considering them.\",\"ADV_01B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? As a staffing advisor, I feel equipped to support hiring managers in hiring persons with priority entitlements.\",\"ADV_01C -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I know where to find Public Service Commission of Canada tools and guidance to help my client managers remove or mitigate biases and barriers in assessment methods that disadvantage persons belonging to an equity-seeking group.\",\"ADV_01D -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? As a staffing advisor, I have received sufficient guidance from my organization to help managers review their assessment methods before they use them to remove or mitigate any biases and barriers that disadvantage persons belonging to an equity-seeking group.\",\"STA_01A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Within my work unit, staffing activities are carried out in a transparent way.\",\"STA_01B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Within my work unit, I believe that we hire people who can do the job.\",\"STA_01C -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? My manager keeps me informed of staffing decisions involving my work unit.\",\"STA_01D -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Within my work unit, the advertised job requirements reflect those of the position to be filled.\",\"STA_01E -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Within my work unit, the process of selecting a person for a position is done fairly.\",\"STA_01F -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly.\",\"STA_02 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, the process of selecting a person for a position is done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why.\",\"STA_03_1 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Non-advertised appointments are never fair\",\"STA_03_2 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Non-advertised appointments are not transparent\",\"STA_03_3 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Non-advertised appointments depend on who you know\",\"STA_03_4 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Non-advertised appointments are not based on merit\",\"STA_03_5 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Non-advertised appointments are not inclusive\",\"STA_03_6 -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Other\",\"STA_03_6_ -- For the statement \\\"Within my work unit, non-advertised appointments are done fairly\\\", you indicated a low level of agreement. Please explain why. Other (please specify)\",\"STA_04 -- Between April 1, 2024 and March 31, 2025, did you act in a position for a period of 4 months or longer?\",\"STA_05 -- Between April 1, 2024 and March 31, 2025, did you participate in an advertised staffing process for a promotion?\",\"STA_06_1 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? No promotion opportunities were available\",\"STA_06_2 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? There was no point in participating because I do not believe that staffing processes are fair\",\"STA_06_3 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? There was no point in participating because advertised positions were meant for specific persons\",\"STA_06_4 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was not interested because I am satisfied with my current group and level\",\"STA_06_5 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was not interested because I am retiring shortly\",\"STA_06_6 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was not interested because I have no interest in moving to a management or executive position\",\"STA_06_7 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was not interested because I am not geographically mobile\",\"STA_06_8 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was concerned that this move would affect my work-life balance\",\"STA_06_9 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was concerned that I have not been at my current group and level for a long time\",\"STA_06_10 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was concerned that my current accommodation measures may not be accepted in a new position\",\"STA_06_11 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was concerned that I might not be successful\",\"STA_06_12 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I was concerned that my pay would be affected by issues with the Phoenix pay system\",\"STA_06_13 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I did not qualify because I did not meet the language requirements for the position\",\"STA_06_14 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I did not qualify because I did not meet the essential qualifications for the position (for example: education, knowledge, experience)\",\"STA_06_15 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? Operational requirements of the position did not suit my personal circumstances (for example: willingness and ability to work overtime on a short notice, willingness to travel)\",\"STA_06_16 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? The application process is burdensome\",\"STA_06_17 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? Staffing processes take too long to complete\",\"STA_06_18 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? Concerns related to accessibility\",\"STA_06_19 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? I don't want to self-declare as part of a staffing process if it's required\",\"STA_06_20 -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? Other reasons\",\"STA_06_20_ -- Why did you not participate in a process for a promotion? Other reasons (please specify)\",\"STA_06B -- You indicated that you did not participate in a staffing process for a promotion due to concerns related to accessibility. Please specify.\",\"STA_07 -- Other than for a promotion, did you participate in an advertised staffing process between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025?\",\"STA_08  -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you withdraw from a staffing process because it took too long?\",\"STA_09A -- Did any of the staffing activities in which you participated result in the following? You participated, as a candidate, in a virtual assessment as part of a selection process.\",\"STA_09B -- Did any of the staffing activities in which you participated result in the following? You were placed in a pool of candidates.\",\"STA_09C -- Did any of the staffing activities in which you participated result in the following? You received an offer of appointment.\",\"STA_10 -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, did you use artificial intelligence (for example, ChatGPT, Gemini by Google, Microsoft Copilot) technology as part of any of the staffing processes you participated in?\",\"STA_11_1 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Writing a cover letter\",\"STA_11_2 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Answering screening questions\",\"STA_11_3 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing for an interview\",\"STA_11_4 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Writing an exam\",\"STA_11_5 --  In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing a resume or CV\",\"STA_11_6 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Preparing for a second language evaluation\",\"STA_11_7 -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Other\",\"STA_11_7_ -- In what part of the staffing process did you use artificial intelligence technology? Other (please specify)\",\"STA_12A -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, as part of a staffing process or second language evaluation, did you request any assessment accommodation measures?\",\"STA_12B -- Were any assessment accommodation measures provided?\",\"STA_12C_1 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Extra time to complete an assessment\",\"STA_12C_2 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Assessment shortened or divided into parts/sessions\",\"STA_12C_3 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Assessment done at home\",\"STA_12C_4 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Visual enhancement technology\",\"STA_12C_5 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Visual replacement technology such as a screen reader\",\"STA_12C_6 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Speech recognition software\",\"STA_12C_7 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Use of a private room\",\"STA_12C_8 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Accommodation measures for persons with difficulty hearing\",\"STA_12C_9 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Wheelchair access\",\"STA_12C_10 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Materials/questions provided ahead of time\",\"STA_12C_11 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Break(s) during an assessment\",\"STA_12C_12 -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Other\",\"STA_12C_12_ -- What type(s) of accommodation did you request and receive? Other (please specify)\",\"STA_12D -- To what extent were you satisfied with the assessment accommodation provided?\",\"STA_12E -- Between April 1, 2024, and March 31, 2025, as part of a staffing process or second language evaluation, did you need any assessment accommodation measures that you did not request?\",\"STA_12F_1 -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? I did not believe that I would receive the accommodation I needed\",\"STA_12F_2 -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? I was concerned that making an accommodation request would reduce my chances of succeeding in the appointment process\",\"STA_12F_3 -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? The process of obtaining an accommodation takes too much time\",\"STA_12F_4 -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? Requesting assessment accommodations is too difficult or complicated\",\"STA_12F_5 -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? Other reason(s)\",\"STA_12F_5_ -- Why did you not request the assessment accommodation measures that you needed? Other reason(s) (please specify)\",\"STA_13 -- Do you agree with the following statement? Within my department or agency, staffing processes are conducted in a way that reduces or eliminates biases and barriers that disadvantage persons belonging to any equity-seeking group, in assessment methods used in staffing processes.\",\"STA_14A -- Did you experience any biases and barriers that disadvantaged you in the staffing process?\",\"STA_14B_1 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Race\",\"STA_14B_2 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? National or ethnic origin\",\"STA_14B_3 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Colour\",\"STA_14B_4 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Religion\",\"STA_14B_5 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Age\",\"STA_14B_6 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Sex\",\"STA_14B_7 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Sexual orientation\",\"STA_14B_8 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Gender identity or expression\",\"STA_14B_9 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Marital status\",\"STA_14B_10 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Family status\",\"STA_14B_11 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Genetic characteristics\",\"STA_14B_12 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Disability\",\"STA_14B_13 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Conviction for an offence for which a pardon has been granted or in respect of which a record suspension has been ordered\",\"STA_14B_99 -- Which of the following prohibited grounds of discrimination under the Canadian Human Rights Act (CHRA) were the basis for the disadvantage that you experienced in the staffing process? Don't know\",\"STA_14C_1 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Job application\",\"STA_14C_2 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Automated screening\",\"STA_14C_3 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Organizational screening\",\"STA_14C_4 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Written exam\",\"STA_14C_5 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Interviews\",\"STA_14C_6 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Reference checks\",\"STA_14C_7 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Appointments\",\"STA_14C_8 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Second language evaluation\",\"STA_14C_9 -- In what part of the staffing process did you feel you experienced biases or barriers? Security clearance\",\"STA_15A -- To what extent are you aware of these mechanisms, should you have concerns regarding an appointment process? Contacting the Public Service Commission of Canada (PSC) to request an investigation into an appointment process\",\"STA_15B -- To what extent are you aware of these mechanisms, should you have concerns regarding an appointment process? Contacting the deputy head responsible for the process to request an investigation into their appointment process\",\"STA_15C -- To what extent are you aware of these mechanisms, should you have concerns regarding an appointment process? Filing a staffing complaint with the Federal Public Sector Labour Relations and Employment Board (FPSLREB)\",\"STA_16A -- Would you ever consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process?\",\"STA_16B_1 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Fear of reprisal\",\"STA_16B_2 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Formal processes are too complicated or too long\",\"STA_16B_3 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Concerned about confidentiality of information provided\",\"STA_16B_4 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Mechanisms are not independent or not transparent\",\"STA_16B_5 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Do not believe it would make a difference\",\"STA_16B_6 -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Other reasons\",\"STA_16B_6_ -- You indicated that you would not consider using one of these mechanisms if you suspected irregularities in an appointment process. Why not? Other reasons (please specify)\",\"STA_17 -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? Diversity and inclusion initiatives related to staffing within my organization are adequate to support building a diverse and representative workforce.\",\"COM_10A -- Did your organization undertake innovative staffing practices or initiatives?\",\"COM_10B -- Enter the innovative staffing practices or initiatives undertaken. Briefly outline them here.\",\"POL_01A -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I am aware of my legal rights and responsibilities for engaging in political activities.\",\"POL_01B -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? If I wanted to seek nomination or become a candidate in a federal, provincial, territorial or municipal election, I am aware of my responsibilities as a public servant.\",\"POL_01C -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I know enough or I know where to find information about engagement in political activities.\",\"POL_01D -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I understand my responsibilities to be politically impartial in carrying out my duties as a public servant.\",\"POL_01E -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? My organization keeps me informed of my responsibilities to be politically impartial in carrying out my duties.\",\"POL_01F -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? In my work unit, employees carry out their duties as public servants in a politically impartial manner.\",\"POL_01G -- To what extent do you agree with the following statement? I am aware that expressing my political views on social media may impact my ability to remain politically impartial or to be perceived as impartial when carrying out my public service duties.\",\"POL_02 -- Between April 1, 2024 and March 31, 2025, other than voting or seeking political candidacy, did you engage in any political activities?\",\"LAB_01 -- Regardless of where you currently work physically, in which region, province or territory do you officially report for work?\",\"ED_01 -- What is the highest certificate, diploma or degree that you have completed?\",\"YRS_01 -- In total, how many years have you been working in your current department or agency?\",\"YRS_02 -- In total, how many years have you been working in the federal public service?\",\"YRS_03 -- In total, how long have you supervised federal public service employees?\",\"YRS_04 -- In total, how long have you been a staffing advisor within the federal public service?\",\"AGG_35 -- What is your age group?\",\"GDR_10 -- What is your gender?\",\"GDR_10_3_ -- What is your gender? Another gender (please specify)\",\"GDR_11A_1 -- What is your sexual orientation? Lesbian\",\"GDR_11A_2 -- What is your sexual orientation? Gay\",\"GDR_11A_3 -- What is your sexual orientation? Bisexual\",\"GDR_11A_4 -- What is your sexual orientation? Asexual\",\"GDR_11A_5 -- What is your sexual orientation? Pansexual\",\"GDR_11A_6 -- What is your sexual orientation? Heterosexual\",\"GDR_11A_7 -- What is your sexual orientation? Another sexual orientation\",\"GDR_11A_8 -- What is your sexual orientation? Prefer not to specify\",\"GDR_11A_7_ -- What is your sexual orientation? Another sexual orientation (please specify)\",\"GDR_11B_1 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Cisgender (a person who identifies with the sex they were assigned at birth)\",\"GDR_11B_2 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Two-Spirit (an Indigenous person in North America who embodies both female and male spirits or whose gender identity, sexual orientation or spiritual identity is not limited by the male/female dichotomy)\",\"GDR_11B_3 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Transgender (a person whose gender does not align with the sex they were assigned at birth)\",\"GDR_11B_4 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Queer (a person whose sexual orientation or gender differs from the normative binary vision of gender and sexuality)\",\"GDR_11B_5 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Questioning (a person who is uncertain of their gender or sexual orientation)\",\"GDR_11B_6 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Intersex (a person whose anatomical and physiological characteristics do not meet the medical criteria of the female or male sex)\",\"GDR_11B_7 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Gender non-binary (a person whose gender does not align with the binary gender model of man or woman)\",\"GDR_11B_8 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Another gender identity\",\"GDR_11B_9 -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Prefer not to say\",\"GDR_11B_8_ -- Do you identify with any of the following groups? Another gender identity (please specify)\",\"FOL_05 -- What is your first official language?\",\"ABM_01_1 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? No\",\"ABM_01_2 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? Yes, First Nations\",\"ABM_01_3 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? Yes, Inuk (Inuit)\",\"ABM_01_4 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? Yes, Métis\",\"ABM_01_5 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? Yes, but prefer not to specify\",\"ABM_01_6 -- Do you identify as an Indigenous person? Prefer not to say\",\"DIS_01_1 -- Are you a person with a disability? No\",\"DIS_01_2 -- Are you a person with a disability? Seeing disability: affects vision, including total blindness, partial sight and visual distortion\",\"DIS_01_3 -- Are you a person with a disability? Hearing disability: affects ability to hear, including being hard of hearing, deafness or acoustic distortion\",\"DIS_01_4 -- Are you a person with a disability? Speech or communication disability: affects ability to talk, including total speech loss, partial speech and speech distortion\",\"DIS_01_5 -- Are you a person with a disability? Mobility disability: affects ability to move your body, including the required use of a wheelchair or a cane, or other issues impacting your mobility\",\"DIS_01_6 -- Are you a person with a disability? Flexibility disability: affects ability to move joints, to bend and to reach for things\",\"DIS_01_7 -- Are you a person with a disability? Dexterity disability: affects ability to perform fine motor tasks, especially with your hands\",\"DIS_01_8 -- Are you a person with a disability? Mental health-related disability: affects psychology or behaviour, such as anxiety, depression or social or compulsive disorder, or phobia or psychiatric illness\",\"DIS_01_9 -- Are you a person with a disability? Sensory or environmental disability: affects sensitivity to lights, sounds, smells or other elements in one's environment, including allergens\",\"DIS_01_10 -- Are you a person with a disability? Chronic health condition: affects ability to function on a regular or episodic basis due to an ongoing health condition\",\"DIS_01_11 -- Are you a person with a disability? Pain-related disability: affects ability to function on a regular or episodic basis due to pain\",\"DIS_01_12 -- Are you a person with a disability? Cognitive disability: ability to carry out tasks involving executive functioning, such as planning and organization\",\"DIS_01_13 -- Are you a person with a disability? Learning disability: affects the way a person receives, understands and uses information, such as dyslexia, dysgraphia and other learning disabilities\",\"DIS_01_14 -- Are you a person with a disability? Memory disability: affects a person's ability to remember information\",\"DIS_01_15 -- Are you a person with a disability? Developmental disability (also known as intellectual disability): affects ability to learn and to adapt behaviour to different situations\",\"DIS_01_16 -- Are you a person with a disability? Another disability\",\"DIS_01_17 -- Are you a person with a disability? Yes, but prefer not to specify\",\"DIS_01_18 -- Are you a person with a disability? Prefer not to say\",\"DIS_01_16_ -- Are you a person with a disability? Another disability (optional to specify)\",\"PG_05_1 -- Do you identify as…? White\",\"PG_05_2 -- Do you identify as…? South Asian (for example: East Indian, Pakistani, Sri Lankan)\",\"PG_05_3 -- Do you identify as…? Chinese\",\"PG_05_4 -- Do you identify as…? Black\",\"PG_05_5 -- Do you identify as…? Filipino\",\"PG_05_6 -- Do you identify as…? Arab\",\"PG_05_7 -- Do you identify as…? Latin American\",\"PG_05_8 -- Do you identify as…? Southeast Asian (for example: Vietnamese, Cambodian, Laotian, Thai)\",\"PG_05_9 -- Do you identify as…? West Asian (for example: Iranian, Afghan)\",\"PG_05_10 -- Do you identify as…? Korean\",\"PG_05_11 -- Do you identify as…? Japanese\",\"PG_05_12 -- Do you identify as…? Other\",\"PG_05_12_ -- Do you identify as…? Other, please specify\",\"PG_06 -- What is your current marital status? Are you...\",\"PG_07 -- Do you have dependants residing in your household?\",\"PG_07_ -- Do you have dependants residing in your household? Yes (please enter number of dependants)\",\"PG_08 -- What is your religion?\",\"PG_08_ -- What is your religion? Other religion and spiritual traditions (please specify)\",\"region1 -- Region1\",\"NCR -- National capital region flag\",\"ALL_D30A -- Grouped occupational groups\",\"EE -- EE group\",\"DEPT -- Department\",\"DPTSIZE -- Department size\",\"GNRATION -- Generation\",\"PEP -- Experience with PE\",\"TwoSLGBTQIAplus -- 2SLGBTQIA+ flag\",\"IIDENT -- Indigenous identity\",\"IIDFLAG -- Indigenous identity flag\",\"VISMIN -- Visible minority status\",\"VISMIN_FL -- Visible minority flag\",\"ALT_COUNT -- Count of alternative recruitment platforms used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_LinkedIn -- Count of steps of the staffing process where LinkedIn was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_Indeed -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Indeed was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_GCconnex -- Count of steps of the staffing process where GCconnex was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_Glassdoor -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Glassdoor was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_Facebook -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Facebook was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_Twitter -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Twitter was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_ERP -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Employee referral programs were used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_VidCruiter -- Count of steps of the staffing process where VidCruiter was used\",\"ALT_STEP_COUNT_Other -- Count of steps of the staffing process where Other platform was used\",\"SELECTED_JOB_POSTER -- Count of ARPs used for job poster\",\"SELECTED_APPLICANT_SCREENING -- Count of ARPs used for Applicant screening\",\"SELECTED_WRITTEN_EXAM -- Count of ARPs used for Written exam\",\"SELECTED_INTERVIEWS -- Count of ARPs used for Interviews\",\"SELECTED_REFERENCE -- Count of ARPs used for Reference checks\",\"SELECTED_APPOINTMENTS -- Count of ARPs used for Appointments\",\"SELECTED_UPDATING_APPLICANTS -- Count of ARPs used for Updating applicants on progress\",\"SELECTED_OTHER -- Count of ARPs used for Other part of the process\",\"ARP_TOTAL -- Count of valid answers for ARP\",\"AI_HMN_COUNT -- Count of steps the staffing process where AI was used by managers\",\"AI_EMP_COUNT -- Count of steps of the staffing process where AI was used by employees\",\"REL_FL -- Religion flag\",\"BB_COUNT -- Barrier Count\",\"GDIS_COUNT -- Count of prohibited grounds of discrimination\",\"DDIS_FL -- Disability flag\",\"DTYPEC -- Number of different types of disabilities\",\"Weight\"]],\"rows\":439,\"sourceRows\":439,\"dupl