 selected\",\"Selected\",\"Not at all\",\"To a minimal extent\",\"To a moderate extent\",\"To a great extent\",\"Don't know\",\"No, I did not have any opportunity to act\",\"No, I had the opportunity but decided not to act\",\"The process is still ongoing\",\"National Capital Region\",\"Ontario\",\"Quebec\",\"Newfoundland and Labrador\",\"Prince Edward Island\",\"Nova Scotia\",\"New Brunswick\",\"Manitoba\",\"Saskatchewan\",\"Alberta\",\"British Columbia\",\"Yukon\",\"Northwest Territories\",\"Nunavut\",\"Outside of Canada\",\"Less than high school diploma or its equivalent\",\"High school diploma or a high school equivalency certificate\",\"Trades certificate or diploma\",\"College, CEGEP or other non-university certificate or diploma\",\"University certificate or diploma below the bachelor's level\",\"Bachelor's degree , BSc, BEd, LLB)\",\"University certificate, diploma or degree above the bachelor's level\",\"3 years to less than 10 years\",\"10 years to less than 20 years\",\"20 years to less than 30 years\",\"30 years or more\",\"1 year to less than 5 years\",\"24 years or under\",\"25 to 29 years\",\"30 to 34 years\",\"35 to 39 years\",\"40 to 44 years\",\"45 to 49 years\",\"50 to 54 years\",\"55 to 59 years\",\"60 years or over\",\"Man\",\"Woman\",\"Another gender\",\"English\",\"French\",\"Married\",\"Living common-law\",\"Separated, but still legally married\",\"Divorced\",\"Single, never married\",\"Widowed\",\"Yes :\",\"No religion\",\"Islam\",\"Hinduism\",\"Buddhism\",\"Sikhism\",\"Judaism\",\"Traditional spirituality\",\"Christianity\",\"Other religion and spiritual traditions\",\"Atlantic\",\"Prairies, Nunavut and Northwest Territories\",\"British Columbia and Yukon\",\"Executive\",\"Scientific and Professional\",\"Administration and Foreign Services\",\"Technical\",\"Administrative Support\",\"Operational\",\"Other\",\"Member of an EE group\",\"Not a member of an EE group\",\"Large\",\"Medium\",\"Small\",\"Very small\",\"Indigenous identity\",\"Non-I